<title>USA: New Hope-Solebury SD, Pa., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>New Hope-Solebury SD, Pa., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
